{"id":17915,"date":"2023-08-01T16:05:03","date_gmt":"2023-08-01T22:05:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=17915"},"modified":"2023-10-23T16:19:11","modified_gmt":"2023-10-23T22:19:11","slug":"newsletter-aug-2023-vol-8-23","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/news-events\/newsletter-aug-2023-vol-8-23\/","title":{"rendered":"Newsletter: Aug 2023 (Vol 8.23)"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"17915\" class=\"elementor elementor-17915\" data-elementor-post-type=\"news\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a2bb5c0 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a2bb5c0\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-182e894\" data-id=\"182e894\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1151eb5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1151eb5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 50px;\">We hope you&#8217;re enjoying summer and able to spend time with family and friends! We&#8217;ve been working hard behind the scenes so check out all the updates we have for you below!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f95bc5e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f95bc5e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft fullWidthMobile\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/jamie-pagliaro-women-behavior-analysis-conference.jpg\" alt=\"Jamie Pagliaro at the Women in Behavior Analysis conference\" \/><\/p><h2 style=\"margin-top: 0px;\">Thanks for joining us at WIBA!<\/h2><p>We always love attending the Women in Behavior Analysis conference!<\/p><p>Thanks to everyone who supported our very own, Dr. Nick Green, presenting on how behavioral science can help you meet your fitness goals. We enjoyed catching up with all our partners at the booth and networking events.<\/p><p>See you next year in Atlanta!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-6ac5c10 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"6ac5c10\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-7186c1c\" data-id=\"7186c1c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8eaa5d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8eaa5d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright\" style=\"margin-top: -7%; max-width: 315px !important; border-radius: 100%; padding: 15px;\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/employee-spotlight-dawn-mackey-product-manager.jpg\" alt=\"Dawn Mackey, Product Manager for RethinkBH\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" \/><\/p><h2 style=\"margin: 0px; color: #ffffff;\">Employee Spotlight<\/h2><h3 style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold;\">Dawn Mackey<em>, Product Manager<\/em><\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Lives in:<\/strong> Berkeley, CA<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite food:<\/strong> Pizza (wood fired preferred!)<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite singer:<\/strong> Stevie Nicks<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>What do you like most about working for Rethink?<\/strong> Working with an amazing group of colleagues to build the best technology tools for our customers.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-966862d vertical-align-middle elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"966862d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full alignleft\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/seashells-starfish.png\" alt=\"Purple illustrations of seashells and starfish\" width=\"125\" height=\"auto\" \/>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 20px;\">August 2023 Events<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf9f014 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bf9f014\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Webinars are moving to BehaviorLive!<\/h3><p>Rethink is excited to announce we have partnered with BehaviorLive to host our live and on-demand webinars and events! We know that this partnership will make the experience of attending events and accessing CE certificates much more streamlined for our users!<\/p><p>As we are making the transition this month, the Our Next Guest and Start-up Community events will be on-demand only. You will still have an opportunity to earn free CEs as a Rethink customer, so be on the lookout for more information to come! <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-15868 aligncenter\" style=\"margin-top: 20px;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/behaviorlive-button.png\" alt=\"BehaviorLive button\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" \/><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-56cd178 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"56cd178\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3dff8e8\" data-id=\"3dff8e8\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2927028 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2927028\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>In Case You Missed It<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-b741814 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b741814\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-cad1e2a\" data-id=\"cad1e2a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ef48cd2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ef48cd2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/portia-james-founder-ceo-behavior-genius.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-15545\" alt=\"Portia James, Founder &amp; CEO of Behavior Genius\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/portia-james-founder-ceo-behavior-genius.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/portia-james-founder-ceo-behavior-genius-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/portia-james-founder-ceo-behavior-genius-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1aaec47 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1aaec47\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Radical Values: When Personal &amp; Professional Values Misalign<\/h3><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>Our Next Guest<\/em> hosted Portia James in July to discuss how perpetual burnout is fueled when values don&#8217;t align &#8211; and what to do about it!<\/p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/radical-values-impacts-misaligned-values-aba-professionals\/\">Get your on-demand CE today<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-36f5a98\" data-id=\"36f5a98\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c7cedbd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c7cedbd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-15088\" alt=\"ABA After Hours, A podcast presented by Rethink Behavioral Health\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e3754f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8e3754f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>ABA After Hours podcast<\/h3><p>Dr. Nick Green joined us in July to talk about his &#8220;solopreneur&#8221; journey as a business owner and how he uses behavioral science to help others meet their fitness goals.<\/p><p>Available\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/open.spotify.com\/episode\/1dnaoht8Ltzgr58Cp6Pf7C?si=098bec20483d4b9f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">wherever you get your podcasts<\/a>!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-bbae160 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"bbae160\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b099972\" data-id=\"b099972\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73783ef elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"73783ef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Features You Don&#8217;t Want to Miss!<\/h2><p>Did you know about the following features available on the Rethink platform? If not, use the links below to guide you and improve your experience!<\/p><h3>Mobile App<\/h3><p><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3523084302\/Program+refresh+after+syncing+with+internet+connection+automastery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Program Refresh<\/a> to reflect program changes when automastery occurs in session<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3522691073\/Preview+Skill+Behavior+Plans+and+Previous+Data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Preview client goals and graphs<\/a> without opening a session for data collection<\/p><p>Release Notes now available on the mobile app!<\/p><h3>Data Collection<\/h3><p><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3437167081\/Automastery+of+Skills+and+Behaviors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Automastery<\/a> option for targets, objectives and programs<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3437166956\/Autofade+Prompt+Levels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Autofade prompt levels<\/a> in skill acquisition programs<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3437559809\/Reordering+Targets+and+Steps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reorder targets and TA steps<\/a> in skill acquisition programs<\/p><h3>Funder Reports<\/h3><p>Duplicate your reports to save you time!<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3510566913\/Custom+Table+Tagging+with+Treatment+Reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Custom Tagging<\/a> available in tables within your template<\/p><h3>Session Notes<\/h3><p>Capture <a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3394208009\/Capture+Remote+Parent+Guardian+Signatures+Billable+Session+Notes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Remote Parent Signatures<\/a> on billable session notes<\/p><h3>Practice Management<\/h3><p><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3512598529\/Ability+to+Add+Multiple+Medicaid+Id+Numbers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Add Multiple Medicaid IDs<\/a> to your Rethink account<\/p><p>New <a href=\"https:\/\/rethink